.github
.vscode
.idea
.vs
.agents
.devcontainer
docs
clients
src/Tests
src/Host/App.AppHost
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/node_modules
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
*.md
